  <compounddef id="structllvm_1_1yaml_1_1_mapping_context_traits" kind="struct" language="C++" prot="public">
    <compoundname>llvm::yaml::MappingContextTraits</compoundname>
    <includes refid="_y_a_m_l_traits_8h" local="yes">llvm/Support/YAMLTraits.h</includes>
    <templateparamlist>
      <param>
        <type>class <ref refid="class_t" kindref="compound">T</ref></type>
      </param>
      <param>
        <type>class Context</type>
      </param>
    </templateparamlist>
    <briefdescription>
<para>This class is similar to <ref refid="structllvm_1_1yaml_1_1_mapping_traits" kindref="compound">MappingTraits&lt;T&gt;</ref> but allows you to pass in additional context for each map operation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For example: <verbatim>struct MappingContextTraits&lt;MyStruct, MyContext&gt; {
  static void mapping(IO &amp;io, MyStruct &amp;s, MyContext &amp;c) {
    io.mapRequired(&quot;name&quot;, s.name);
    io.mapRequired(&quot;size&quot;, s.size);
    io.mapOptional(&quot;age&quot;,  s.age);
    ++c.TimesMapped;
  }
}; 
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
